"Approximate Preview" = "近似预览";
"Code was not run and the project configuration was not applied" = "未执行代码、未应用项目配置";
"Opens .qmd documents and previews callouts, cross-references, code cells and includes approximately; code is never run." = "打开 .qmd 文档，近似预览 callout、交叉引用、代码单元和 include；不执行代码。";
